WEBVTT

00:21.970 --> 00:23.350
Aniplex

01:31.570 --> 01:33.470
Yoyo-san, are you all right?

01:34.260 --> 01:35.280
Nene-chan!

01:35.280 --> 01:36.260
I'm here!

01:41.840 --> 01:44.700
Because he's made of water, we're having all sorts of trouble.

01:44.700 --> 01:47.230
Level two magic hasn't worked at all so far.

01:47.230 --> 01:50.080
Nene-chan! Let's give <i>that</i> a try!

01:50.080 --> 01:50.770
Okay!

01:51.260 --> 01:53.190
All right! Here we go!

02:18.180 --> 02:20.220
My poor forest...

02:21.940 --> 02:25.040
Missing... you say?

02:28.470 --> 02:31.520
Yes. It's been twelve years since my sister disappeared.

02:31.970 --> 02:34.870
I tried to track her down using her belongings, but then...

02:36.020 --> 02:37.330
<i>that</i> appeared.

02:40.210 --> 02:41.220
Yoyo-san!

02:41.880 --> 02:44.350
And now, for the finishing touch...

02:49.450 --> 02:50.230
Hoi!

02:51.330 --> 02:52.950
Summon!

03:17.030 --> 03:19.220
I <i>might</i> have overdone it a teensy bit.

03:24.080 --> 03:26.580
Nene-chan!

03:27.680 --> 03:30.120
Good to see you safe as well, Yoyo-san.

03:31.470 --> 03:34.860
Hey, Nils! What do you mean "as well"!?

03:35.580 --> 03:39.210
Oh, Nene-chan, you've got something on you! Let me help.

03:40.640 --> 03:42.330
Nils, you're being obnoxious.

03:43.720 --> 03:44.600
Bihaku!?

03:46.460 --> 03:48.560
You brought my hat!

03:49.240 --> 03:50.290
Thank you.

03:52.610 --> 03:53.350
Um...

03:56.610 --> 03:58.640
Thank you very much.

03:58.640 --> 03:59.550
Don't mention it!

04:00.210 --> 04:03.430
Picture book level

04:00.210 --> 04:03.430
Powerful magic users

04:00.210 --> 04:03.430
and reverse curses

04:00.210 --> 04:03.430
Spell Shop

04:00.210 --> 04:03.430
We set the standard

04:00.210 --> 04:03.430
The best

04:00.210 --> 04:00.260
Yoyo

04:00.210 --> 04:00.260
Nene

04:00.960 --> 04:03.820
We shell out spells and reverse curses. We're the magical sisters!

04:03.430 --> 04:03.470
and reverse curses

04:03.430 --> 04:03.510
Picture book level

04:03.430 --> 04:03.510
Powerful magic users

04:03.430 --> 04:03.510
Spell Shop

04:03.430 --> 04:03.510
We set the standard

04:03.430 --> 04:03.510
The best

