1:39:51.420 --> 1:39:53.090
And now we wait three minutes.

1:39:53.630 --> 1:39:55.170
We have to wait?

1:39:56.300 --> 1:39:58.130
That's the best part.

1:39:58.130 --> 1:39:58.180
Market pricing

1:39:58.130 --> 1:39:58.180
Casting and removing

1:39:58.130 --> 1:39:58.180
Spell casters.

1:40:01.390 --> 1:40:02.430
I'll get it!

1:40:06.520 --> 1:40:10.310
Welcome! We shell out spells and reverse curses.
We're the magical sisters!
